        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International AP-PH-6682, 18 Inch Hampton Collection Appliance Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 18 Inch Hampton Appliance Pull comes packaged with hardware to install it on a refrigerator or other appliance door panel. It has a transitional look that is well-suited for the top design trends in the industry. It looks modern and homey--the perfect finishing touch to any home remodel where comfort meets style. The 18 Inch Hampton Collection Appliance Pull is available in several finish colors. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe AP-PH-6682 Hampton Collection Appliance Pull is not just for refrigerators. Add a cohesive and look throughout your kitchen by adding them to every appliance in your home.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/hampton-cabinet-pull-rk-international-cp-681\"><b>Matching Hampton Cabinet Pull</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/12-inch-hampton-refrigerator-pull-rk-international-ap-ph-6681\"><b>12 Inch Hampton Collection Appliance Pull</b></a> \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Hampton Collection Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 19-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting screws for a refrigerator/appliance door panel.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
